---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import UniversalInput from '../components/UniversalInput.astro';import {pageMetadata as meta} from '../config/pages.js';
---
<BaseLayout {...meta.home}>
 <section class="hero"><div class="container"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">LOCAL · DETERMINISTIC · REVIEWED PATHS</span><h1>Find the safest next step<br/><span>when DevOps breaks.</span></h1><p>Paste a supported error, command output, configuration, or symptom. HelpDevOps analyzes supported evidence locally and routes you toward reviewed guidance without inventing certainty.</p><div class="tool-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#analyze">Analyze something</a><a class="button secondary" href="/troubleshoot/">Browse troubleshooting</a></div></div><div id="analyze"><UniversalInput /></div></div></section>
 <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">START WITH WHAT YOU HAVE</span><h2>One workflow, several safe entry points</h2></div></div><div class="quick-grid"><a class="card quick-card" href="/interpret/"><span class="capability">INTERPRET</span><h3>Command output</h3><p>Turn supported operational output into observations, unknowns, and a next check.</p></a><a class="card quick-card" href="/tools/"><span class="capability">ANALYZE</span><h3>Use a deterministic tool</h3><p>Validate supported configuration and calculations with visible limits.</p></a><a class="card quick-card" href="/reference/"><span class="capability">UNDERSTAND</span><h3>Look up a concept</h3><p>Connect reviewed operational distinctions to relevant workflows.</p></a></div></div></section>
 <section class="section"><div class="container two-col"><article class="workspace-card"><span class="eyebrow">CONTINUE LOCALLY</span><h2>Keep the investigation coherent</h2><p>Explicitly save supported state, then build a privacy-controlled Incident Brief for verification or handover. Browser storage is continuity, not permanent backup.</p><div class="tool-actions"><button class="button ghost" type="button" data-session-open>Open Session Dock</button><a class="button secondary" href="/incident-brief/">Build Incident Brief</a></div></article><article class="preflight-card"><span class="eyebrow">TRUST BOUNDARIES</span><h2>Evidence before certainty</h2><ul><li>Nothing is uploaded or saved automatically.</li><li>Results state what was checked and what remains unknown.</li><li>Private-key-like material is blocked from local saves and briefs.</li></ul><a href="/privacy/">Review privacy boundaries →</a></article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
